  @@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
  +Each task's delivery state consists of its Task-cell references, reservation or work-item identity, per-branch delivery links and completion state.
  +
   - **Task ids.**
     - An unreserved task awaiting its pull request links its file in the planning record: `[W01]()`. The file name is the task id in lower case.
     - Every link on a task row names that row's id, and the row carries one delivery per long-lived branch its unit changes. A reserved task links only its planning folder: `[W01]()`. Every row of a joined unit links the one folder its first row names. The folder's README links each work-item file by the name the row's link carries. Releasing the reservation points the row to that file.
