  --- skills/work-planner/artifacts/hotfix.md
  +++ skills/work-planner/artifacts/hotfix.md
  @@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
  +A repository-qualified reference to the hot-fix's delivering pull request.
  +
   - A pull request delivers a hot-fix when its title opens with the hot-fix's prefix, `[F00] Purpose`, it lives in the hot-fix's repository, its base is the hot-fix's [target](#target), and its Development field links the hot-fix.
   - It is opened from the hot-fix's [branch](#branch), as a draft.
   - It is marked ready for review only once its review cycle is complete: its current [agent review](#review-record) leaves every finding fixed.
